*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0017
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-04-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-03 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 961
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0017.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    05 TRAN-CNT-DAY       PIC 9(3).
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TXN-AMOUNT         PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> DAYS SINCE ACCOUNT OPENED
    05 ACCT-AGE-DAYS      PIC 9(5).
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 RISK-GRADE         PIC X VALUE 'L'.
    *> FRAUD RISK SCORE
    05 FRAUD-SCORE        PIC 9(3) VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM SCORE-VELOCITY
    DISPLAY "RISK-GRADE=" RISK-GRADE
    DISPLAY "FRAUD-SCORE=" FRAUD-SCORE
    STOP RUN.
SCORE-VELOCITY.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN TRAN-CNT-DAY > 15 AND TXN-AMOUNT GREATER THAN 7000
            MOVE 'H' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 90 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        *> ELEVATED TRANSACTION VELOCITY
        WHEN TRAN-CNT-DAY > 10
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 60 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN ACCT-AGE-DAYS < 90
            MOVE 'M' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 40 TO FRAUD-SCORE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'L' TO RISK-GRADE
            MOVE 10 TO FRAUD-SCORE
    END-EVALUATE.
